  "title": "Basic commands and advice",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Give simple health advice",
      "content": "Use familiar affirmative *tú* commands to give simple advice: *descansa*, *toma agua*, *come algo*, *duerme* and *ve al médico*."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Simple advice",
      "rows": [
        [
          "Descansa.",
          "Rest."
        ],
        [
          "Toma agua.",
          "Drink water."
        ],
        [
          "Come algo.",
          "Eat something."
        ],
        [
          "Duerme.",
          "Sleep."
        ],
        [
          "Ve al médico.",
          "Go to the doctor."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "examples",
      "items": [
        {
          "spanish": "Descansa y toma agua.",
          "english": "Rest and drink water."
        },
        {
          "spanish": "Duerme bien.",
          "english": "Sleep well."
        },
        {
          "spanish": "Ve al médico.",
          "english": "Go to the doctor."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "content": "These are simple affirmative *tú* commands used as practical advice. Keep the advice short and familiar."
    }
  ]
